## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design strong delivery guarantees in multi-tenant KCNA, including dedup, offsets, and isolation during rebalances.

## Key Concepts

- Exactly-once semantics across tenants and rebalance events
- Deduplication strategy using tenant_id and message_id
- Atomic offsets and transactional writes to downstream systems
- Tenant isolation boundaries during rebalances and migrations

## Code Example

